---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Our Story">
  <section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 md:py-24">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-ink-900 mb-8">Our Story</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-lg text-ink-700 space-y-6">
      <p>Since 2020 we have been establishing a small no-dig market garden here on the Isle of Man.</p>
      <p>We grow vegetables and herbs using no-dig methods, organic and permaculture principles, and zero synthetic chemicals. All our seeds are open-pollinated or heirloom varieties.</p>
      <p>The aim is simple: nutritious food for our family and our community, grown in a way that leaves the soil better than we found it.</p>
      <p>We are a small initiative. We are always learning.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>